  "question": {
    "text": "If the solubility product of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi></math> in pure water at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is____ (Nearest integer) [Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>41</mn></math>]"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "282",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mover><mo>&#8652;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Let us consider the solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi></math>&nbsp;is &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>&quot; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>.</p><p>Thus,</p><p>Solubility product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ksp</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>We know</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>282</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
